file tools/fixtures/t/topology_graph_census.sh the floor leg -- moore_cap, moore_floor, floorleg and the four attainer binds, with the split-graph refusal
file tools/fixtures/t/topology_floor_control.sh 23 behaviors, five plants each shown from the failing side, the pen proven innocent and the legs proven to earn their keep
